people so they can translate that to a
paper than your writer and I have

00:01:02.100 --> 00:01:06.990
learned to do that by doing it doing it
and hearing it and reading it and seeing

00:01:06.990 --> 00:01:11.340
it so reading scripts helps yes but you
got to see the outcome of that scripts

